OL,3,GNEWSAHandwritten 200-year-old P45 found
OL,4,Aon roof tile
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat appears to be a 200-year-old
OL,7,Fletter of dismissal, written on a roof
OL,8,Fslate, has been found at a salvage
OL,9,Fyard.
OL,11,FThe tile, informing what is thought to
OL,12,Fbe a 19th-century pottery worker that
OL,13,Fhe was no longer needed, was found at
OL,14,FCawarden Reclaim in Rugeley,
OL,15,FStaffordshire,
OL,17,FThe message had been written into soft
OL,18,Fclay before the Staffordshire Blue tile
OL,19,Fwas fired, and reads: "I do hereby
OL,20,Fdischarge you, John Lewis, from my
OL,21,Femployment, Thomas Austin."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
