OL,3,GNEWSAHandwritten 200-year-old P45 found
OL,4,Aon roof tile
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch had found a firm called Thomas
OL,7,FAustin Brick & Tile Makers, based at
OL,8,FClay Hills, Stoke-on-Trent in 1820,
OL,9,Fwhich could be the business referenced
OL,10,Fon the tile, the firm said.
